  "html": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-secondary-color has-text-color has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Engineering leader · Writer · Speaker</p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-x-large-font-size\">I build software for hospitals, and write about what technology and life keep teaching me.</h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I’m Sakti Prasad Bagchi. For 25 years I’ve built healthcare software used by US hospitals, and today I lead engineering teams across India and the US. This is where I share notes from two schools at once: the fast-changing world of AI and engineering, and the slower university of life.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/blog.html\">Read the essays</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--5\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/where-technology-meets-human-insight-2.html\">About me</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"5760\" height=\"3840\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/yk8a5383.jpg\" alt=\"Portrait of Sakti Prasad Bagchi\" class=\"wp-image-6017\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator alignwide has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What I write about</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-tertiary-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-0e4ecca0 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"/technology-and-ai.html\">AI &amp; Technology</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">AI coding, agent harnesses, context engineering and enterprise AI adoption, from an engineering leader’s desk.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-tertiary-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-0e4ecca0 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"/category/leadership-2/\">Leadership &amp; Work</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Leading teams, making better decisions, and building a career you can be proud of.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-tertiary-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-0e4ecca0 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"/category/philosophy/\">Philosophy &amp; Inner Life</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Everyday moments and Indian wisdom traditions, turned into reflections on how we think, live and grow.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Also: <a href=\"/category/self-realization/\">Self-Realization</a> · <a href=\"/category/emotions/\">Emotions</a> · <a href=\"/category/society/\">Society</a> · <a href=\"/category/fiction/\">Stories &amp; Series</a> · <a href=\"/ai-concepts.html\">AI Concepts</a></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator alignwide has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Latest writing</h2>\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__list is-grid columns-3 has-dates alignwide wp-block-latest-posts is-layout-flow wp-block-latest-posts-is-layout-flow\"><li><div class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__featured-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/life-as-sakti-6aa0caf07abcc.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"Rocks bursting upward beside a calm lake at sunset\" /></div><a class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"/2026/09/09/the-stones-we-carry-how-i-freed-myself-from-self-doubt/\">The Stones We Carry: How I Freed Myself from Self-Doubt</a><time class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-date\">September 9, 2026</time></li>\n<li><div class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__featured-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/life-as-sakti-6a93d67b456d5.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"Open book with glowing paths winding through mountains, scenes, and forests\" /></div><a class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"/2026/08/30/fragments-elephant-doctor-forest-llms-and-books/\">Fragments: Elephant Doctor, Forest, LLMs and Books</a><time class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-date\">August 30, 2026</time></li>\n<li><div class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__featured-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" /></div><a class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"/2026/08/11/introducing-odia-panjika-%e0%ac%93%e0%ac%a1%e0%ac%bc%e0%ac%bf%e0%ac%86-%e0%ac%aa%e0%ac%9e%e0%ad%8d%e0%ac%9c%e0%ac%bf%e0%ac%95%e0%ac%be-bridging-odishas-cultural-rhythm-with-modern-technolo/\">Introducing Odia Panjika (ଓଡ଼ିଆ ପଞ୍ଜିକା): Bridging Odisha’s Cultural Rhythm with Modern Technology</a><time class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-date\">August 11, 2026</time></li>\n<li><div class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__featured-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/life-as-sakti-6a78b25c59a7f.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"Floating rocky islands with trees, houses, and bridges above a mountainous landscape at sunset.\" /></div><a class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"/2026/08/09/i-forget-that-other-people-exist/\">I Forget That Other People Exist</a><time class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-date\">August 9, 2026</time></li>\n<li><div class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__featured-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/life-as-sakti-6a66c33fc07de.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" alt=\"Gears labeled learning, building, sharing, collaboration, and exchange interconnected in a machine\" /></div><a class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"/2026/07/27/the-relevance-flywheel-a-practitioners-framework-for-staying-sharp-in-the-age-of-ai/\">The Relevance Flywheel: A Practitioner’s Framework for Staying Sharp in the Age of AI</a><time class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-date\">July 27, 2026</time></li>\n<li><a class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"/2026/07/14/the-escape-hatch/\">The Escape Hatch</a><time class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-date\">July 14, 2026</time></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide has-tertiary-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-9d77fd4c wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Get new essays by email</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">One thoughtful piece at a time, no noise. Technology essays also go out on <a href=\"https://straydog77.substack.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">The Tech Strategist’s Edge</a>.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n",
